  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DHT">Lemma <span data-tag="0DHT">15.85.2</span>.</a> Let $R \to A$ be a flat ring map of finite presentation. The $R$-perfect objects of $D(A)$ form a saturated<a class="footnotemark" href="#a0000359355" id="a0000359355-mark"><sup>1</sup></a> triangulated strictly full subcategory. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
